        f"[⌯] 𝗣𝗹𝗮𝗻 ⌁ {plan_def.get('name', 'Unknown')} ⭐\n"
        f"[⌯] 𝗦𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗰𝗲 ⌁ {p.get('source', 'key').title()} 🔑\n"
        f"[⌯] 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗶𝗿𝗲𝘀 ⌁ {format_expiry(uid)} ⏳"
    ), parse_mode='html')


